  "content": "<p>這是VEINMINER&nbsp;<br>想像一下你正在挖掘一個<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>超大</strong> </span>的煤礦脈，那過程簡直要花上<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>天荒地老</strong></span>…沒錯吧？&nbsp;</p><p>嗯，這一切都改變了</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#236fa1\"><strong>運作方式</strong></span>&nbsp;<br>只要破壞<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>一</strong> </span>個方塊，整條礦脈就會<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>全部碎裂</strong></span>&nbsp;<br>總之，好好享受吧</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/vayBGB2hwb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/vayBGB2hwb</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>特別感謝&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>@sketchisbeingfr 更新此模組，快去支持他，他是一位很棒的模組作者</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>如有問題請至 Discord 尋求協助</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>預告片 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?si=ZyMnBu0BlKnMcDdU&amp;v=JUzI_5JR87I&amp;feature=youtu.be\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?si=ZyMnBu0BlKnMcDdU&amp;amp;v=JUzI_5JR87I&amp;amp;feature=youtu.be</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>我的頻道 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Jupkke\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jupkke - YouTube</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
